{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2021-05-10 17:37:00', 'title': 'EQT ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQT CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: EQT) (THE "COMPANY" OR "EQT") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS PRICED A PRIVATE OFFERING TO ELIGIBLE PURCHASERS UNDER RULE 144A AND REGULATION S OF THE SECURITIES ACT OF 1933, AS AMENDED (THE "SECURITIES ACT"), OF $500\xa0MILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 3.125% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026 AND $500\xa0MILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 3.625% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2031 (TOGETHER, THE "NOTES" AND SUCH OFFERING, THE "OFFERING").\xa0 THE NOTES WILL BE ISSUED AT PAR.'}